---@field matchLabels? azure.iotoperations.VolumeClaimSpecSelectorMatchLabelsMap MatchLabels is a map of {key,value} pairs. A single {key,value} in the matchLabels map is equivalent to an element of matchExpressions, whose key field is "key", the operator is "In", and the values array contains only "value". The requirements are ANDed.

