---@field secretRef string Kubernetes secret containing an X.509 client certificate. This is a reference to the secret through an identifying name, not the secret itself.

---@class azure.iotoperations.Options
---@field api_base_url? string from $AZURE_API_BASE_URL; default https://management.azure.com
---@field authority_host? string from $AZURE_AUTHORITY_HOST; default https://login.microsoftonline.com
